---
/**
 * SellWithChat live chat widget (an ApexChat white-label).
 *
 * The widget renders its own launcher/CTA, so there is nothing to style and no
 * chat card in the contact section. It must be present on every page —
 * BaseLayout renders this before the site script.
 *
 * `is:inline` so Astro emits the tag verbatim instead of bundling it.
 * The protocol-relative URL is the vendor's snippet as supplied; on the live
 * HTTPS domain it resolves to HTTPS.
 */
---

<script is:inline src="//sellwithchat.com/scripts/invitation.ashx?company=thepinholeclinic" async></script>
